    "passives": {
      "HailToTheKingPassiveAKingArthurModern": {
        "id": "HailToTheKingPassiveAKingArthurModern",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "Cold-Blooded Successor",
          "description": "If this unit would be defeated, it instead survives with 1 HP and then cannot be defeated until its next turn. This effect can trigger only once each time this unit enters the battlefield, and is considered a Hold Ground+ effect.\n\nThis unit cannot be Stunned until it has defeated 1 enemy with an attack while on the battlefield.\n\nEach time this unit takes damage from an attack while it does not have Counter Stance and survives until after the end of the turn, this unit will be healed for 100% of its max HP, and be granted Counter Stance for 150TU. Counter Stance will overwrite status effects on this unit. The next time the unit with counter stance takes damage from an enemy attack, it will become their turn.\n\nThis unit's attacks heal this unit for 100% of total damage dealt, and ignore any effects of non-boss enemies that would prevent targets from being defeated.\n\nAfter entering the battlefield, for 150TU, after the end of each of this unit's turns, this unit has a 20% chance, plus 20% chance per Awakening (up to 100% chance if this unit has 4 Awakenings) to randomly either:\n- Disable the enemy with the lowest current TU for 30TU.\n- Give the next turns to all other allies on the battlefield by reducing their current TU. These TU reductions may trigger before or after other effects that adjust the turn order.\n- Fortify 2 random non-fortified allies.\n\nWhen a unit's Active Skills are disabled and they get the turn, they will lose the turn as if they were sleeping. This effect cannot affect boss units, cannot be purified, and will end if this unit is defeated. A Fortified unit has 50% damage reduction from attacks. This reduction cannot be ignored by attacks that do not specifically ignore Fortify. Fortify will be removed after reducing damage 3 times since applying, and will be reset if reapplied. This is not a status effect."
        }
      },
      "SuperBuffPlusKingArthur": {
        "id": "SuperBuffPlusKingArthur",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "King's Dawn+",
          "description": "This unit's Attack is increased to 1.5x.\nThis unit's Active Skill TU Costs are reduced by 50%.\nThis unit has 50% damage reduction from attacks.\n\nAll of these effects are triggered when this unit begins on the battlefield at the very start of battle, and will end if this unit leaves the battlefield. This unit cannot be sent to the reinforcements from the battlefield.\n\n-This Attack increase does not stack with Enrage effects.\n-This will not reduce TU Costs to below 1TU.\n-Quicken effects will not further reduce this unit's TU costs."
        }
